                    },
                    "message": "Lets change the file name to FirmwareInfo.yaml instead."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Configuration/FirmwareInfoDef.yaml",
                    "line": 15,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Let's not do that since then we will not have any clear mapping from the schema to the PDI yaml.\n\nIn ```firmware.json``` the schema is defined like\n```\n    \"$defs\": {\n        \"FirmwareInfoDef\": {\n            \"description\": \"This indicates the properties which apply to all firmwares\",\n\n```\n\nSo i would prefer to use the name as already defined in the schema instead of making a new name for the same thing.\n\nLet me know if you would like the name in the schema to be adjusted instead."
                }
